  "solution": {
    "text": "The greatest term in the expansion of <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></math> is the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>∉</mo><mi>Z</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mo>⋅</mo></mfenced></math> is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math><br />Here,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>51</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>52</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>104</mn><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br />Thus, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>7</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term is the greatest term."
  }
